   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2020-01-30",
   "text": "Protecting Natural Gas Consumers from Overcharges Act of 2020\n This bill provides authority for the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to establish a refund effective date and order refunds for rates and charges by any natural-gas company in connection with the transportation or sale of natural gas."
